                        <lb/>
                        C.F.M.(46) 197</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-07-06">6 July, 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Peace Treaty With Italy</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">tenth report on the work of the
                        committee of naval experts</hi></p>
                <p>1. In accordance with the decision of the Ministers taken on 27th April, 1946,
                    the Naval Committee has examined the question of the Yugoslav and Greek claims
                    for Italian Warships, which are contained in documents C.F.M.(D) (46)44, C.F.M.(46) 29 and C.F.M.(46)
                        69.<anchor n="64" xml:id="d248-f2"/></p>
                <pb facs="0841" n="817" xml:id="pg817"/>
